  m_Name: Grenade launcher_GunData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: GL-7A
  descriptionEnglish: The GL-7A is a devastating weapon capable of obliterating entire
    hordes of demons with a single shot.  One must be cautious when handling this
    grenade launcher, as the explosive force it generates is known to cause collateral
    damage and potentially kill the wielder.
  nameChinese: "\u69B4\u5F39\u53D1\u5C04\u5668"
  descriptionChinese: "\u69B4\u5F39\u53D1\u5C04\u5668\u662F\u4E00\u79CD\u6BC1\u706D\u6027\u6B66\u5668\uFF0C\u80FD\u591F\u7528\u5355\u53D1\u5C04\u51FB\u6467\u6BC1\u6574\u4E2A\u6076\u9B54\u7684\u5927\u7FA4\u3002\u4F7F\u7528\u8FD9\u79CD\u69B4\u5F39\u53D1\u5C04\u5668\u65F6\u5FC5\u987B\u5C0F\u5FC3\u8C28\u614E\uFF0C\u56E0\u4E3A\u5B83\u4EA7\u751F\u7684\u7206\u70B8\u529B\u4F1A\u9020\u6210\u9644\u5E26\u635F\u5BB3\u5E76\u6709\u53EF\u80FD\u81F4\u4F7F\u6301\u6709\u8005\u4E27\u751F\u3002"
  namePortuguese: GL-7A
  descriptionPortuguese: "O GL-7A \xE9 uma arma devastadora capaz de obliterar hordas
    inteiras de dem\xF4nios com um \xFAnico tiro. Deve-se ter cautela ao manusear
    este lan\xE7ador de granadas, pois a for\xE7a explosiva que ele gera \xE9 conhecida
    por causar danos colaterais e potencialmente matar o usu\xE1rio."
  nameSpanish: GL-7A
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "La GL-7A es una arma devastadora capaz de aniquilar
    hordas enteras de demonios con un solo disparo. Se debe tener cuidado al manejar
    este lanzagranadas, ya que la fuerza explosiva que genera es conocida por causar
    da\xF1os colaterales y potencialmente matar al portador."
